If a pregnant-person has a pain then the pregnant-person should receive a compassionate-evidence-based-care for the pain.
If a pregnant-person has an opioid-use-disorder then the pregnant-person should receive a compassionate-evidence-based-care for the opioid-use-disorder.
If a postpartum-person has a pain then the postpartum-person should receive a compassionate-evidence-based-care for the pain.
If a postpartum-person has an opioid-use-disorder then the postpartum-person should receive a compassionate-evidence-based-care for the opioid-use-disorder.
If a parenting-person has a pain then the parenting-person should receive a compassionate-evidence-based-care for the pain.
If a parenting-person has an opioid-use-disorder then the parenting-person should receive a compassionate-evidence-based-care for the opioid-use-disorder.
